      "writtenOn": "2022-07-28T20:33:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was picturing having them exist separately, just so the conversion isn\u0027t allowed, and the TEST macros have to read correctly at the site. We could achieve that without the copy-pasting, if it makes people happier. It seems like CTSEnforced needs at least one of UNDEFINED/NEVER or FUTURE? Right? How do we specify a test that doesn\u0027t run? (For that reason, I prefer NEVER over UNDEFINED, also).",
      "parentUuid": "452def25_36e38b11",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 26,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 30,
        "endChar": 6
      },
      "revId": "596f896719a0a495974372831f031670db30f030",
